SOAPBOX: station was compromised for the entire weekend. Conditions were better than expected
SOAPBOX: on Saturday with a decent opening to NA on 10m, but that wasn't repeated on Sunday.
SOAPBOX: Although we couldn't be competitive it was fun and we surely appreciated all the QSOs!
